    <description>Check For Approval Record Status and update the Opportunity Stage accordingly to Verbal Selection or Closed Won.
Automate the Legal Approval Request to auto approved. Updated BOPI-554 Notify users when opp is auto closed/won.
BOPI-525 Updated to include an entry criteria
BOPI-669 Close won Opp only after CR approval
BOPI-799 Add an update to the Previous Stage field to trigger Process Builder slack messages
BOPI-844 Create a ByPass for approvals to allow moving Opportunities to &apos;Closed Won&apos; without having to go through an approval process.
BOPI-846 Use the validation rule ByPass to prevent the quote update from failing.
BOPI-951 Update Ship To Account on Opp Account Update
SALDEV-1357 Added the decision to check PrimaryQuote IsBlank.
SALDEV-1356 Updated the Exclusivity Field update to avoid updating the flow post closed opp in the auto create order flow.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
